(N'202', N'youtube', N'The Love of My Life<br>Lyricist: Tang Shuchen<br>Composer: Lo Koon Ting<br>Arranger: Lo Koon Ting<br><br>Lyrics:<br>==========<br>The past, present, and future will never return again,<br>Red leaves are buried deep within the dust,<br>Beginnings and endings remain unchanged,<br>You, afar, drift beyond the white clouds.<br><br>Love and hate surge in the sea of bitterness,<br>In this world, one cannot escape fate,<br>Though drawn to each other, we cannot draw near,<br>Perhaps I should believe it is destiny.<br><br>After parting, my lover will never return again,<br>Sitting silently alone, gazing beyond the mortal world,<br>Though flowers wither,<br>They will bloom again,<br>The love of my life looms faintly<br>Beyond the white clouds.<br><br>Love and hate surge in the sea of bitterness,<br>In this world, one cannot escape fate,<br>Though drawn to each other, we cannot draw near,<br>Perhaps I should believe it is destiny.<br>==========<br><br>Love and hate surge in the sea of bitterness, in this world, one cannot escape fate,<br>Though drawn to each other, we cannot draw near,<br>Perhaps I should believe it is destiny,<br>Perhaps I should believe it is destiny.', N'1', N'2025-06-10'),
