(N'166', N'youtube', N'我只是上星期才認識、第一次聽譚維維的歌(歌手2024蘭花花)，然後到這裏。立即成為粉絲了。 🥰 <br>She really is an true artist. It doesn&#39;t matter if she didn&#39;t win the singing contest. She is my winner! She has a very unique style and I fell in love with her songs. Such talent. Such emotion. I really can&#39;t hear it else where. And she is absolutely beautiful too!! <br><br>In the parallel universe, if she would perform this in Eurovision, she would definitely win!!!!!!!', N'1', NULL),
