(N'204', N'youtube', N'闻说你时常在下午来这里寄信件<br>Man syut nei si seung joi ha ng loi je leui gei seun gin<br>逢礼拜留连艺术展还是未间断<br>Fung lai baai lau lin ngai seut jin waan si mei gaan tyun<br>何以我来回巡逻遍仍然和你擦肩<br>Ho yi ngo loi wui cheun lo pin ying yin wo nei chaat gin<br>还仍然在各自宇宙错过了春天<br>Waan ying yin joi gok ji yu jau cho gwo liu cheun tin<br><br>只差一点点即可以再会面<br>Ji cha yat dim dim jik ho yi joi wui min<br >可惜偏偏刚刚擦过<br>Ho sik pin pin gong gong chaat gwo<br>十面埋伏过孤单感更赤裸<br>Sap min maai fuk gwo gu daan gam gang chek lo<br>总差一点点先可以再会面<br>Jung cha yat dim dim sin ho yi joi wui min<br>仿佛应该一早见过但直行直过<br>Fong fat ying goi yat jou gin gwo daan jik hang jik gwo<br>只差一个眼波将彼此错过<br>Ji cha yat go ngaan bo jeung bei chi cho gwo<br><br>迟两秒搭上地下铁能与你碰上么<br>Chi leung miu daap seung dei ha tit nang yu nei pung seung mo<br>如提前十步入电梯谁又被错过<br>Yu tai chin sap bou yap din tai seui yau bei cho gwo<br>和某某从来未预约为何能见更多<br>Wo mau mau chung loi mei yu yeuk wai ho nang gin gang do<br>全城来撞你但最后处处有险阻<br>Chyun sing loi jong nei daan jeui hau chyu chyu yau him jo<br><br>只差一点点即可以再会面<br>Ji cha yat dim dim jik ho yi joi wui min<br>可惜偏偏刚刚擦过<br>Ho sik pin pin gong gong chaat gwo<br>十面埋伏过孤单感更赤裸<br>Sap min maai fuk gwo gu daan gam gang chek lo<br>总差一点点先可以再会面<br>Jung cha yat dim dim sin ho yi joi wui min<br>仿佛应该一早见过但直行直过<br>Fong fat ying goi yat jou gin gwo daan jik hang jik gwo<br>只等一个眼波<br>Ji dang yat go ngaan bo<br><br>轨迹改变角度交错<br>Gwai jik goi bin gok dou gaau cho<br>寂寞城市又再探戈<br>Jik mok sing si yau joi taam gwo<br>天空闪过灿烂花火<br>Tin hung sim gwo chaan laan fa fo<br>和你不再为爱奔波<br>Wo nei bat joi wai oi ban bo<br><br>总差一点点先可以再会面<br>Jung cha yat dim dim sin ho yi joi wui min<br>悔不当初轻轻放过<br>Fui bat dong cho hing hing fong gwo<br>现在惩罚我分手分错了么<br> Yin joi ching fat ngo fan sau fan cho liu mo<br>分开一千天天天盼再会面<br>Fan hoi yat chin tin tin tin paan joi wui min<br>只怕是你先找到我但直行直过<br>Ji pa si nei sin jaau dou ngo daan jik hang jik gwo<br>天都帮你去躲躲开不见我<br>Tin dou bong nei heui do do hoi bat gin ngo', N'0', N'2024-10-17'),
