(N'206', N'youtube', N'Translation of Wo Long Yin<br><br>I started to study knowledge when I was young. <br>To learn Cultivation of morality and self-cultivation<br><br>Look up observe the stars and look down to observe the earth​, keep the knowledge and strategy in deep my mind(heart)<br><br>Being a farmer but never forget to pay my duty to my country (Han dynasty)<br><br>Who knows my blood is boiling while I am living in countryside( around bushes and montains)<br><br>Phoenix, Phoenix, do you know my ambitions <br><br>I have been kept in silence for so long when Han dynasty is in Kaos.<br><br>Thanks to emperor&#39;s uncle(Liu Bei) visit my cottage for three times.<br><br>He treat me as close friend and ask me how to end this Kaos.<br><br>He (Liu Bei) sigh that he met me so late. Half of his life was wasted.<br>As a nobody from countryside,I was so moved by him. (Zhuge Liang was moved by Liu Bei as royal family blood visit him three times )<br><br>I am going to pick up my sword and leaving my cottage with him tomorrow.<br><br>To the warfare as his war counselor<br><br>Dragon，Dragon，finally I meet a wise lorder. (Like wind meet cloud)<br><br>I shoot out loudly and sigh Finally I have a chance to achieve my goal.<br><br>I wish I can come back be a farmer after I help him to end this kaos.<br><br>Again, living in my cottage among wind and clear moon. So the Apes and birds can hear music from my strings.<br><br><br>​', N'0', NULL),
