(N'183', N'youtube', N'要用诚心待人，有句话叫“诚能移性”，也就是说，真诚能够把你的心、把你的本性都转移。所以，用真诚心去对别人好，你能控制人性的走向。也就是说，你到底是一个恶人，还是一个好人？如果你用真诚去对别人，你可能就成为一个善人；如果你用恶心去对别人，你可能就是一个恶人。', N'0', NULL),
(N'183', N'youtube', N'Official Description from Bilibili<br>Translation (Self Translation, might be lacking in ways, please point out if I am wrong):<br>In 676 AD, during the reign of Emperor Gaozong of Tang, the Tang Dynasty troops stationed at the Xuanwu Gate of the North Gate of the Taiji Palace one day sounded the sound of &quot;The Broken Array Music of the King of Qin&quot;. &quot;King of Qin&quot; is not only a sound in the army to boost morale and praise the merits of Li Shimin, the king of Qin, but also a famous Tang music dance. After hearing this, a white-headed old palace lady in Taiji Palace suddenly recalled a night feast witnessed in 626 A.D. half a century ago and the palace change the next morning without warning...<br>The song &quot;Listen! The Broken Array of the King of Qin!” It is precisely this witness to the change of Xuanwu Gate, the White-headed Palace Lady, who heard the music of &quot;The King of Qin&quot; and evoked a lamentable memory. The spirited Tang Dynasty at the night banquet, the witness of the murder when the palace changed and fled, the hero&#39;s momentary frustration and loneliness...<br>I hope this music can bring you feelings that the lyrics can&#39;t bring. This time, the pipa challenge was used to imitate people&#39;s panic, fear, and trembling. I hope that you can continue to look forward to the &quot;Good Song of Women&quot; in the future, and I will use the pipa to depict the sound of wind, rain, and thunder and challenge myself again.<br><br>Original Chinese Version (Added):<br>中文版：<br>搬运一下柳美女在b站的官方解释：<br>“公元676年唐高宗时代，太极宫北门玄武门驻扎着的唐朝军队某天传出《秦王破阵乐》的声音。《秦王》既是军队中鼓舞士气、赞颂秦王李世民功绩之音，又是著名的唐乐舞。太极宫一位白头老宫女听到后突然回忆起半个世纪前公元626年目睹的一场夜宴以及翌日清晨毫无征兆的宫变……<br>这首《听！秦王破阵乐！》正是这位玄武门之变的见证者白头宫女听到《秦王》音乐所勾起的一段令人唏嘘的回忆。夜宴上意气风发的大唐、宫变逃窜时的命案目睹记、英雄一瞬的失意与孤独……<br>希望这首音乐能带给大家歌词不能带来的感受。这一次用琵琶挑战模仿出人的惊慌、恐惧、战栗。希望大家能继续敬请期待后面的《妇好歌》，我将用琵琶描摹风雨雷电的声音，再次挑战自己。”<br>- Chinese version from “the end (Youtube)”', N'41', NULL),
(N'183', N'youtube', N'A great feast to my ears. Thank you so much! I would really appreciate your effort and enjoy the talent of your team, and you in particular. Your video makes me more appreciate one aspect of the Chinese culture and my Chinese root. It really touches my deep inner soul. I could travel back to thousand years ago by my imagination through you video and your music.', N'74', NULL),
