(N'223', N'youtube', N'原来他们还不会控制情感<br>Yuanlai tamen hai bu hui kongzhi qinggan<br>也还没破解如何死去活来<br>ye hai mei pojie ruhe siquhuolai<br>不过大脑所产生的悲哀<br>bu guo danao suo chansheng de bei’ai<br>好像能让愉快更痛快<br>haoxiang neng rang yukuai geng tongkuai<br><br>保持最佳的气候是有多难<br>baochi zui jia de qihou shi you duo nan<br>这里竟然还会有四季变换<br>zheli jingran hai hui you siji bianhuan<br>但所谓雪花比记载更好看<br>dan suowei xuehua bi jizai geng haokan<br><br>我一定要尽快调查明白<br>wo yiding yao jinkuai diaocha mingbai<br>这落后星球魅力何在<br>zhe luohou xingqiu meili hezai<br>早该返航的队长怎么会不愿离开<br>zao gai fanhang de duizhang zenme hui bu yuan likai<br><br>我们早进化到完美状态<br>women zao jinhua dao wanmei zhuangtai<br>为何还会迷恋平凡<br>weihe hai hui milian pingfan<br>难道生命没缺陷<br>nandao shengming mei quexian<br>反而是一种缺憾<br>fan’er shi yi zhong quehan<br><br>简陋的血肉之躯非常脆弱<br>jianlou de xierou zhi qu feichang cuiruo<br>却又比铜头铁臂多点温暖<br>que you bi tong tou tie bi duo dian wennuan<br><br>莫非生命就是要很短暂<br>mofei shengming jiushi yao hen duanzan<br>才能明白时间多需在<br>caineng mingbai shijian duo xu zai<br>地球上看我星像一粒尘埃<br>diqiu shang kan wo xing xiang yi li chen’ai<br>若人类发现该多兴奋崇拜<br>ruo renlei faxian gai duo xingfen chongbai<br>我们派来的却不肯再回来<br>women pai lai de que bu ken zai huilai<br><br>我一定要尽快调查明白<br>wo yiding yao jinkuai diaocha mingbai<br>这落后星球魅力何在<br>zhe luohou xingqiu meili hezai<br>早该返航的队长怎么会不愿离开<br>zao gai fanhang de duizhang zenme hui bu yuan likai<br>我们早进化到完美状态<br>women zao jinhua dao wanmei zhuangtai<br>为何还会迷恋平凡<br>weihe hai hui milian pingfan<br>难道生命没缺陷<br>nandao shengming mei quexian<br>反而是一种缺憾<br>fan’er shi yi zhong quehan<br><br>我想我慢慢地终于明白<br>wo xiang wo man man de zhongyu mingbai<br>这落后星球有多可爱<br>zhe luohou xingqiu you duo ke’ai<br>好想好想学队长勇敢地不再离开<br>hao xiang hao xiang xue duizhang yonggan di bu zai likai<br>我们越进化到完美状态<br>women yue jinhua dao wanmei zhuangtai<br><br>越会更加迷恋平凡<br>yue hui gengjia milian pingfan<br>那些不完美生命怎么会还看不开<br>naxie bu wanmei shengming zenme hui hai kan bu kai', N'0', N'2024-01-02'),
