(N'150', N'youtube', N'[ENGLISH SUBTITLE VIEWERS] This is a classic female general hides her identity, wins wars, and retires only to find fiance now wishes to marry another woman. She avenges his insults, and finds her purpose, but first she must face the greatest nemesis in cdrama. The long arguments.<br><br>Even in the 3rd scene where the fiance brings the agreement to terminate the engagement, the verbal exchange is 15 minutes long. Each time you think it is coming to a close, another character joins and starts arguing, pleading or accusing. Eventually, it mercifully is done.<br><br>But oh no. The next scene is the wedding ceremony, and there starts the next argument. This time, not only are there new characters being introduced, there is false identity and mistaken identity. There is a brief fight and I think all is resolved but no! There is a post battle argument. With onlooker contribution. <br><br>This continues for most of the movie.<br><br>2/10. In this story, FL can end enemies and end wars, but alas, she cannot end conversations from going on abd on and on and on....', N'1', NULL),
